+                  rd6->touchdowns == 1 && rd6->testMs == 0 && !rd6->noData && rd7 && rd7->noData,
+              "8d. the A8 misread (no names, not 956): col 13 'A' = one Order, col 27 'Aa' = no Test Time -> 1 touchdown, "
